# Verification

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#tests) for test authorization and toolchain selection. Use the smallest real workload that answers the verification question.

For the seed, use `cod-seed --parse` for syntax, `--check-declarations` for module binding, or `--translate` for generated artifacts. A runtime check links the translated C entry with its required providers and runtime. See the [booter build instructions](../../applications/cod-booter/README.md#build-and-run-on-linux) for the full application route.

Use `tests/toolchain/run-all.sh` for requested toolchain tests. `COD_TEST_TOOLCHAIN=build` selects the development toolchain and `COD_TEST_TOOLCHAIN=built` selects a prepared release toolchain.
